  "Prop": {
   "description": "One illustration from the library, with a gentle built-in idle animation (sun rays turn, waves roll, heart beats, gears spin). (x,y) is its CENTRE; size = height in px (default 160). Other elements can target its anchors as \"id.anchor\" (every prop has center/top/bottom/left/right plus its own, see the catalog). `state` 0–1 drives fill levels, growth or glow; `stateKeys` animate it. `talk` moves its mouth with the narration (Storybook faces).",
   "props": {
    "type": "object",
